    "group": "Canoptek Court",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Either Fight Phase, or the Shooting Phase on your opponent’s turn. After an enemy unit finishes attacking, choose a CRYPTEK model of yours destroyed by those attacks. The model is still a valid target despite its destruction. For the rest of the battle, your CANOPTEK models get +1 to Hit rolls and +1 to Wound rolls against that enemy unit.",
